# Connect a Windows UI to Point Taken

Put a `.point-taken.json` file at the project root, for example `{ "projectId": "orders" }`. Use the same stable project ID in the app's adapter. Point Taken uses it to route reports to the queue that agents read from the checkout.

## Give every app control a source ID

